 r←Test_UC_203(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;tempDir;project;parms;success;log;ref;rc;msg;res
⍝ Call ]Cider.LinkConfig without an argument while more than one project is open, and select nothing.
⍝ Used to crash with a VALUE ERROR because the result was not set.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 #.⎕EX¨'TEMP' 'TEMP2'
 'TEMP'#.⎕NS''
 'TEMP2'#.⎕NS''
 tempDir←∆GetFolderInTempDir⊃⎕SI
 tempDir ⎕NCOPY⍠('Wildcard' 1)('IfExists' 'Replace')⊢##.CiderConfig.HOME,'/Tests/Test_Alias/*'
 ref←∆GetRefToCommTools
 ref.AddAutomation'YesOrNo' 'ChangeCurrentDir@' 'n'
 :For project :In 'Project1' 'Project2'
     parms←##.Cider.CreateOpenParms ⍬
     parms.folder←tempDir,'/',project
     parms.watch←'ns'
     parms.ignoreUserExec←1
     parms.batch←1
     (success log)←##.Cider.OpenProject parms
     →T.GoToTidyUp~success
 :EndFor

 ref.AddAutomation'Select' 'Select a Cider project:'⍬
 (rc msg res)←∆UCMD'LinkConfig'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠rc
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'Cancelled by user'⍷res

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 ref.Cleanup
 {}⎕SE.Link.Break'#.TEMP'
 {}⎕SE.Link.Break'#.TEMP2'
 #.⎕EX¨'TEMP' 'TEMP2'
 (rc msg)←FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce tempDir
 msg Assert 0=rc
⍝Done
